  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuestionnaireManager
  questions:
  - questionText: How much mental and perceptual activity was required (e.g. thinking,
      deciding, calculating, remembering, looking, searching, etc)? Was the task
      easy or demanding, simple or complex, exacting or forgiving?
    minLabel: 0
    maxLabel: 100
  - questionText: How much physical activity was required (e.g. pushing, pulling,
      turning, controlling, activating, etc)? Was the task easy or demanding, slow
      or brisk, slack or strenuous, restful or laborious?
    minLabel: 0
    maxLabel: 100
  - questionText: How much time pressure did you feel due to the rate of pace at
      which the tasks or task elements occurred? Was the pace slow and leisurely
      or rapid and frantic?
    minLabel: 0
    maxLabel: 100
  - questionText: How successful do you think you were in accomplishing the goals
      of the task set by the experimenter (or yourself)? How satisfied were you with
      your performance in accomplishing these goals?
    minLabel: 0
    maxLabel: 100
  - questionText: How hard did you have to work (mentally and physically) to accomplish
      your level of performance?
    minLabel: 0
    maxLabel: 100
  - questionText: How insecure, discouraged, irritated, stressed and annoyed versus
      secure, gratified, content, relaxed and complacent did you feel during the
      task?
    minLabel: 0
    maxLabel: 100
